# Revisions that changed formatting only. `git blame` should skip them, or every
# line in the repository attributes to a mechanical reformat rather than to the
# change that actually introduced it.
#
# Use with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Only add a revision here if it is provably formatting-only: the test suite must
# be identical before and after, and the diff must contain no semantic change.
